HHIISSTTOORRYY
     An llppdd daemon appeared in Version 5 AT&T UNIX.

     llppdd previously required that clients connected using a privileged port
     (below 1024).  This restriction was removed because it does not provide
     additional security and also because many modern clients connect using an
     unprivileged port.

